== relational schema
Relational schema
Notation: _name_ primary key, /name/ foreign key, _/name/_ both

Trainee : {(_traineeID_ : integer)}
Workshop : {(_workshopID_ : integer)}
Trainee_attends_Workshop : {(_/traineeID/_ : integer, _/workshopID/_ : integer)}

Foreign keys
  Trainee_attends_Workshop.traineeID -> Trainee.traineeID
  Trainee_attends_Workshop.workshopID -> Workshop.workshopID

Not enforced by the schema
